/target/
/web/node_modules/
/web/dist/
/web/test-results/
/web/playwright-report/
/web/blob-report/
!/web/dist/.gitkeep

# Environment-provided credentials, at any directory depth.
.[Ee][Nn][Vv]
.[Ee][Nn][Vv].*
*.[Ee][Nn][Vv]
*.[Ee][Nn][Vv].*
.[Ee][Nn][Vv][Rr][Cc]
.[Dd][Ii][Rr][Ee][Nn][Vv]/
!*.[Ee][Nn][Vv].[Ee][Xx][Aa][Mm][Pp][Ll][Ee]
!*.[Ee][Nn][Vv].[Ss][Aa][Mm][Pp][Ll][Ee]
!*.[Ee][Nn][Vv].[Tt][Ee][Mm][Pp][Ll][Aa][Tt][Ee]

# Private keys and credential containers must never be tracked.
*.[Kk][Ee][Yy]
*.[Pp][Ee][Mm]
*.[Pp]12
*.[Pp][Ff][Xx]

# Databases and logs may contain private document metadata or encrypted
# credentials. SQLite can use several sidecar suffixes depending on mode.
*.[Dd][Bb]
*.[Dd][Bb]-*
*.[Dd][Bb].*
*.[Ss][Qq][Ll][Ii][Tt][Ee]
*.[Ss][Qq][Ll][Ii][Tt][Ee]-*
*.[Ss][Qq][Ll][Ii][Tt][Ee]3
*.[Ss][Qq][Ll][Ii][Tt][Ee]3-*
*.[Ll][Oo][Gg]
*.[Ll][Oo][Gg].*
[Gg][Ii][Tt][Ll][Ee][Aa][Kk][Ss]-[Rr][Ee][Pp][Oo][Rr][Tt].*
[Gg][Ii][Tt][Ll][Ee][Aa][Kk][Ss]-[Rr][Ee][Ss][Uu][Ll][Tt][Ss].*
*.[Ss][Aa][Rr][Ii][Ff]

# PaperlessLLM runtime state for any custom --data-dir location.
.[Mm][Aa][Ss][Tt][Ee][Rr]-[Kk][Ee][Yy]
[Pp][Aa][Pp][Ee][Rr][Ll][Ee][Ss][Ss]-[Ll][Ll][Mm].[Ll][Oo][Cc][Kk]
[Pp][Aa][Pp][Ee][Rr][Ll][Ee][Ss][Ss]-[Ll][Ll][Mm].[Ii][Nn][Ss][Tt][Aa][Nn][Cc][Ee]
.[Pp][Aa][Pp][Ee][Rr][Ll][Ee][Ss][Ss]-[Ll][Ll][Mm].[Ii][Nn][Ss][Tt][Aa][Nn][Cc][Ee].*.[Tt][Mm][Pp]
.[Pp][Aa][Pp][Ee][Rr][Ll][Ee][Ss][Ss]-[Ll][Ll][Mm]/

# Credential-bearing local data backups. Release archives do not match these
# timestamp/backup-specific names.
*.[Bb][Aa][Kk]
*.[Bb][Aa][Cc][Kk][Uu][Pp]
*.[Dd][Uu][Mm][Pp]
[Pp][Aa][Pp][Ee][Rr][Ll][Ee][Ss][Ss]-[Ll][Ll][Mm]-[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9].[Tt][Aa][Rr].[Gg][Zz]
[Pp][Aa][Pp][Ee][Rr][Ll][Ee][Ss][Ss]-[Ll][Ll][Mm]-[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9].[Zz][Ii][Pp]
[Pp][Aa][Pp][Ee][Rr][Ll][Ee][Ss][Ss]-[Ll][Ll][Mm]-[Bb][Aa][Cc][Kk][Uu][Pp]*.[Tt][Aa][Rr].[Gg][Zz]
[Pp][Aa][Pp][Ee][Rr][Ll][Ee][Ss][Ss]-[Ll][Ll][Mm]-[Bb][Aa][Cc][Kk][Uu][Pp]*.[Tt][Gg][Zz]
[Pp][Aa][Pp][Ee][Rr][Ll][Ee][Ss][Ss]-[Ll][Ll][Mm]-[Bb][Aa][Cc][Kk][Uu][Pp]*.[Zz][Ii][Pp]
[Pp][Aa][Pp][Ee][Rr][Ll][Ee][Ss][Ss][Ll][Ll][Mm]-[Bb][Aa][Cc][Kk][Uu][Pp]*.[Tt][Aa][Rr].[Gg][Zz]
[Pp][Aa][Pp][Ee][Rr][Ll][Ee][Ss][Ss][Ll][Ll][Mm]-[Bb][Aa][Cc][Kk][Uu][Pp]*.[Tt][Gg][Zz]
[Pp][Aa][Pp][Ee][Rr][Ll][Ee][Ss][Ss][Ll][Ll][Mm]-[Bb][Aa][Cc][Kk][Uu][Pp]*.[Zz][Ii][Pp]
.[Pp][Aa][Pp][Ee][Rr][Ll][Ee][Ss][Ss]-[Ll][Ll][Mm]-[Bb][Aa][Cc][Kk][Uu][Pp][Ss]/

.DS_Store
